Chora — bundled font notices
============================

The TV typeface is selected at build time by the `fonts` flavor dimension. Both flavors
provide the same four resource names (`res/font/chora_display_regular/medium/semibold/bold`),
so application code never branches on the flavor. Each flavor owns its files outright — no
resource is overridden across source sets.

SF Pro (sfpro flavor)
---------------------
SF Pro is a trademark of Apple Inc. The `sfpro` flavor bundles it at the project owner's
discretion (see apple-music-tv-spec.md §14.1), for personal use only. The typeface is NOT
part of this repository and is NOT covered by its Apache-2.0 license: the files live in
`app/src/sfpro/res/font/`, which is gitignored, and must never be published. The public
`foss` flavor — what CI, F-Droid and store builds use — ships the open font below instead.

Expected files (see `app/src/sfpro/FONTS.md`):

  chora_display_regular.otf   SF Pro Display Regular   (400)
  chora_display_medium.otf    SF Pro Display Medium    (500)
  chora_display_semibold.otf  SF Pro Display Semibold  (600)
  chora_display_bold.otf      SF Pro Display Bold      (700)

Record the source and SHA-256 of each file here when they are added. They cannot be filled
in from a clean checkout, and the `sfpro` variant does not compile without them.

